{"id":"25b9260c94f77a3a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Abstract Elementary Class","display":"df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class — ZFC Logic9 Abstract Elementary Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class — ZFC Logic9 Abstract Elementary Class","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-logic9-loewenheim-skolem-number]]","[[../batch13/58-df-substructure]]","[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure]]","[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class — ZFC Logic9 Abstract Elementary Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e0df337ab683f77\" href=\"?note=9e0df337ab683f77\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-logic9-loewenheim-skolem-number\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-logic9-loewenheim-skolem-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure\">../batch13/58-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01f4b76e2e096590\" href=\"?note=01f4b76e2e096590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism\">../batch15/58-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure\">../batch18/58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},L\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded structure class, strong-substructure order, and common language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Substructure}_S,\\mathrm{Iso}_S,\\mathrm{PartOrd},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Substructure}_S,\\mathrm{Iso}_S,\\mathrm{PartOrd},\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (underlying-set operator for structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9LoewenheimSkolemNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9LoewenheimSkolemNumber}_S\\)</span> (Loewenheim-Skolem number predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}_S(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},L)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathcal K\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartOrd}(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(M\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N\\to\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M,N,L)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L)\\land\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,M,N,L)\\to N\\in\\mathcal K\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M_0,M_1,N_0,N_1\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall f_0,f_1\\;\\Bigl(\nM_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_1\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f_0,M_0,N_0,L)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f_1,M_1,N_1,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land f_1\\upharpoonright\\mathrm{Univ}(M_0)=f_0\\to N_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N_1\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M_0,M_1,M_2\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M_0,M_1,L)\\land M_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_2\\land M_1\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_2\n\\to M_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_1\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta\\;\\forall\\vec M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\delta\\;(M_i\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Univ}(U)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\delta}\\mathrm{Univ}(M_i)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;(M_i\\leq_{\\mathcal K}U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal K\\;((\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;M_i\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N)\\to U\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9LoewenheimSkolemNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}_S(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},L)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathcal K\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartOrd}(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(M\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N\\to\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M,N,L)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall N\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L)\\land\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,M,N,L)\\to N\\in\\mathcal K\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M_0,M_1,N_0,N_1\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall f_0,f_1\\;\\Bigl(\nM_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_1\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f_0,M_0,N_0,L)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f_1,M_1,N_1,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land f_1\\upharpoonright\\mathrm{Univ}(M_0)=f_0\\to N_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N_1\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall M_0,M_1,M_2\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M_0,M_1,L)\\land M_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_2\\land M_1\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_2\n\\to M_0\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_1\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta\\;\\forall\\vec M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\delta,\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\delta\\;(M_i\\leq_{\\mathcal K}M_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Univ}(U)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\delta}\\mathrm{Univ}(M_i)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;(M_i\\leq_{\\mathcal K}U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal K\\;((\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;M_i\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N)\\to U\\leq_{\\mathcal K}N)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9LoewenheimSkolemNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Isomorphism closure, coherence, chain unions, and the correctly typed Loewenheim--Skolem condition are all explicit; the former formula left the first three as undeclared predicates and omitted 